---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import experience from '@/data/experience.yaml';
---
<BaseLayout title="Experience" description="Academic and industry experience, with achievements and connected research."><div class="page"><p class="eyebrow">Experience</p><h1>Research engineering across lab, field, and factory.</h1><p class="lede">Each role sharpened a different layer of deployable intelligent systems: embedded devices, computer vision, manufacturing pipelines, cloud infrastructure, and field operations.</p><div class="timeline" style="margin-top:50px">{experience.map(e=><article class="timeline-item"><span class="date">{e.start} - {e.present?'present':e.end} / {e.location}</span><h2>{e.role}</h2><p><strong>{e.organization}</strong> / {e.type}</p><p>{e.summary}</p><ul>{e.achievements.map(a=><li>{a}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</div></div></BaseLayout>
